<title>THAILAND: Thailand Jan budget surplus at 453.1 mln baht.</title>
<headline>Thailand Jan budget surplus at 453.1 mln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand recorded a budget surplus of 453.1 million baht in January against a deficit of 32.49 billion baht in December, a finance ministry official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
